msgctxt "help/370/0"
msgid "Help with Wells"
msgstr "Ziehbrunnen-Hilfe"

msgctxt "help/370/1"
msgid ""
"A well is a cheap way to create a water supply for a relatively small "
"area. Wells do not create any pipe access. They can be built anywhere, "
"but they only supply a primitive water supply that will limit land "
"values.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#371Tips# "
msgstr ""
"Mit einem Ziehbrunnen kann man billig eine Wasserquelle für ein relativ "
"kleines Gebiet erschließen. Ziehbrunnen brauchen keinen Wasseranschluß. "
"Sie können überall gebaut werden, bieten aber nur eine primitive "
"Wasserversorgung und schränken dadurch den Landwert ein.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#371Tips# "

msgctxt "help/371/0"
msgid "Tips for Wells"
msgstr "Tips für Ziehbrunnen "

msgctxt "help/371/1"
msgid ""
"If you're the unsavory sort that builds \"slums\" to supply businesses "
"with convenient workers, you may find wells to be a cheap source of "
"water for them.  Housing near businesses can't grow into mansions "
"anyway, so a primitive water supply shouldn't be of much concern. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#370Help#"
msgstr ""
"Ziehbrunnen tendieren zwar dazu, \"Slum\"-Gebiete zu kreieren, in denen "
"Arbeiter für Ihre Betriebe wohnen, aber Sie haben mit einer solchen "
"Wasserversorgung eine billige Möglichkeit, die Leute dort "
"zufriedenzustellen. Da Wohnungen in der Nähe von Betrieben sich ohnehin "
"nicht zu Villen und Prachtbauten entwickeln, kann Ihnen der durch die "
"primitive Wasserversorgung ebenfalls stagnierende Wohnungsbau ohnehin "
"gleichgültig sein. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#370Hilfe#"

