msgctxt "help/415/0"
msgid "Help for Towers"
msgstr "Hilfe für Türme"

msgctxt "help/415/1"
msgid ""
"Towers strengthen walls, and serve as posts for soldiers. If invaders "
"enter the city, soldiers will emerge from your towers to counterattack. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#416Tips# / #447 History#"
msgstr ""
"Türme verstärken die Mauern und dienen als Aufenthaltsort für Soldaten. "
"Wenn Invasoren die Stadt stürmen, verlassen die Soldaten ihre Türme für "
"einen Gegenangriff. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#416Tips# / #447 Geschichte#"

msgctxt "help/416/0"
msgid "Tips for Towers"
msgstr "Tips für Türme"

msgctxt "help/416/1"
msgid ""
"If you sense that barbarians are always approaching your city from the "
"same directions, try building groups of towers along the walls that "
"they first hit.  Also make sure to build gates near the towers to give "
"your soldiers better access to the enemy. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#415Help# / #447 History#"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie bemerken, daß Barbaren Ihre Stadt immer wieder von derselben "
"Seite aus angreifen, sollten Sie eine Reihe von Türmen an den "
"Stadtmauern bauen, die zuerst betroffen sind. Denken Sie auch daran, "
"Stadttore neben den Türmen zu bauen, damit die Soldaten den Feind "
"besser erreichen können.  \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#415Hilfe# / #447 Geschichte#"

