msgctxt "help/430/0"
msgid "Help with Gates"
msgstr "Hilfe bei Toren"

msgctxt "help/430/1"
msgid ""
"Gates allow your people tomove through any walls you build. To build a "
"gate, just run a section of road through a wall, or vice versa.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#431Tips# / #447History#"
msgstr ""
"Tore ermöglichen den Leuten den Durchgang durch alle von Ihnen gebauten "
"Mauern. Um ein Tor zu bauen, lassen Sie einfach ein Stück Straße durch "
"die Mauer laufen und umgekehrt.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#431Tips# / #447Geschichte#"

msgctxt "help/431/0"
msgid "Tips for Gates"
msgstr "Tips für Tore "

msgctxt "help/431/1"
msgid ""
"If you have built a wall around your city, you can better defend it by "
"building a road just inside the wall, and placing barracks next to that "
"road at regular intervals.  Make sure you build gates on the road as "
"well, so that your soldiers can reach enemies before they enter the "
"city. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#430Help# / #447History#"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie eine Mauer um Ihre Stadt ziehen, erhöht sich der Grad der "
"Verteidigung, wenn Sie innerhalb der Mauer auch noch eine Straße bauen "
"und in regelmäßigen Abständen Kasernen neben dieser Straße errichten. "
"Denken Sie daran, die Straße mit Toren zu versehen, damit Ihre Soldaten "
"den Feind erreichen können, bevor dieser in die Stadt durchbricht. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#430Hilfe# / #447Geschichte#"

