msgctxt "help/790/0"
msgid "Help with Towns"
msgstr "Hilfe bei Dörfern und Städten"

msgctxt "help/790/1"
msgid ""
"Roman Towns are communities that are friendly toward the Roman Empire, "
"and welcome its authority. At the beginning of a game, however, these "
"Towns will be rather small and isolated from your Capital City.\n"
"\n"
"By building road connections between your Capital City and and any "
"outlying Towns, you will improve your business trade, and you will "
"likely see the Towns grow in size.\n"
"\n"
"#791Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Römische Dörfer sind Gemeinschaften, die dem römischen Imperium "
"freundlich gegenüberstehen und seine Autorität anerkennen. Zu Beginn "
"des Spiels sind diese Dörfer allerdings ziemlich klein und weit "
"entfernt von Ihrer Hauptstadt.\n"
"\n"
"Indem Sie Straßen bauen zwischen der Hauptstadt und außenliegenden "
"Dörfern verbessern Sie den Handel und können den Siedlungen regelrecht "
"zusehen, wie sie wachsen und gedeihen.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#791Tips#"

msgctxt "help/791/0"
msgid "Tips for Towns"
msgstr "Tips für Städte und Dörfer "

msgctxt "help/791/1"
msgid ""
"Connecting outlying towns to your city via provincial roads will help "
"the towns to grow and will improve the economy of your capital city. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#790Help#"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie die draußen liegenden Dörfer mit Ihrer Hauptstadt über Straßen "
"verbinden, hilft dies den Siedlungen zu wachsen und verbessert die "
"Wirtschaft Ihrer Stadt. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#790Hilfe#"

