msgctxt "help/970/0"
msgid "Help with Quarries"
msgstr "Hilfe bei Abbaugebieten"

msgctxt "help/970/1"
msgid ""
"Quarries can be placed on Rocky Areas, indicated by rocky patches on "
"your Province Map. As with farms, quarrying options will vary from "
"province to province. You may choose to quarry stone, clay, marble, or "
"sand. A Quarry needs road access, a Warehouse, and a Workhouse.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"
msgstr ""
"Abbaugebiete können in den felsigen Gebieten Ihrer Provinz-Karte "
"plaziert werden. Wie die Bauernhöfe sind Abbaugebiete von Provinz zu "
"Provinz verschieden. Sie können wählen, ob Sie Stein, Ton, Marmor oder "
"Sand abbauen. Abbaugebiete benötigen eine Straßenanbindung, ein "
"Lagerhaus und ein Arbeitercamp.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#896Tips#"

msgctxt "help/971/0"
msgid "Industries and Industrial Support"
msgstr "Betriebe und unt. Einrichtungen"

msgctxt "help/971/1"
msgid ""
"When selecting a site for an industry, make sure that it has plenty of "
"empty space next to it so that you can give it road access, a work camp "
"and one or more warehouses.  Some sites will have more accessibility "
"than others.\n"
"\n"
"Don't build more workcamps than you can easily fill with plebs; if you "
"do, all of your industries will suffer for it.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
