msgctxt "help/1068/1"
msgid ""
"This button allows you to place five types of structures that help "
"defend your city from attack. \n"
"\n"
"For Walls: #445Help# / #446Tips# / #447History# \n"
"For Towers: #415Help# / #416Tips# \n"
"For Gates: #430Help# / #431Tips# \n"
"For Barracks: #475Help# / #476Tips# \n"
"For Praefectures: #460Help# / #461Tips# / #462History#"
msgstr ""
"Mit diesen Buttons plazieren Sie fünf Bauwerke, die Ihre Stadt vor "
"Angriffen schützen. \n"
"\n"
"Für Mauern: #445Hilfe# / #446Tips# / #447Geschichte# \n"
"Für Türme: #415Hilfe# / #416Tips# \n"
"Für Tore: #430Hilfe# / #431Tips# \n"
"Für Kasernen: #475Hilfe# / #476Tips# \n"
"Für Präfekturen: #460Hilfe# / #461Tips# / #462Geschichte#"

